# standards-audit allowlist — documented exemptions for the offline secrets scan.
#
# Format: one pattern per line. Lines starting with `#` are comments. An inline
# trailing comment (after whitespace #) is accepted as the exemption justification.
#
# Patterns match in either of two ways:
#   * path pattern  — matches the git-tracked file path (fixed string), or
#   * substring     — matches any line of the scanned content.
#
# Reviewer-owned: adding an exemption must be justified here. Prefer fixing the
# violation over suppressing it; exemptions are reviewed on audit.
#
# Example — exclude a git-tracked fixture that intentionally plants a credential
# pattern so the scan ruleset itself stays strict:
# standards-audit/fixtures/non-conformant-app-k8s/secrets/.env.planted   # planted fixture credential